<div class="card">
    <h2>Step 5: Overall CEFR Level &amp; Feedback</h2>
    <p class="form-hint">
        Free-text narrative summary for the candidate. The overall CEFR-mapped
        grade (A&ndash;E) is computed from the criterion ratings entered in
        Step 4 when you submit the assessment.
    </p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label for="ci_examiner_notes">Clinical Communication &mdash; Examiner Notes</label>
        <textarea id="ci_examiner_notes" name="clinical_indicators.examiner_notes"
                  placeholder="Narrative summary of the candidate&rsquo;s clinical communication in Welsh">{{ clinical_indicators.examinerNotes }}</textarea>
    </div>

    <p class="form-hint">
        Reminder: an empty (fully unrated) submission grades as E by design,
        to ensure a blank assessment is never mistaken for a passing
        performance. Grade B / CEFR C1 is the typical Welsh-medium clinical
        threshold per NHS Wales <em>More Than Just Words</em>.
    </p>
</div>
